# build output
obj/
out/
*.obj
*.res
*.pdb
*.ilk
# executables are built, except the two Win98 binaries the kit ships so that a project can pack on the Mac
# without building the stub first (rebuild them with nmake in the repository root)
*.exe
!bin/setup98.exe
!bin/pack98.exe
!bin/s98test.exe
# the self-contained example's prebuilt program (built by examples/demo/src/Makefile with VC6)
!examples/demo/s98demo.exe
# test fixture (a text file named .exe)
!tests/data/pk/game.exe
# the native pack98 (macOS/Linux) is built by make (tools/pack98 does it on demand)
bin/pack98
.DS_Store
